Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ASoC: qcom: x1e80100: also limit the WSA mix path digital
 volumes

Each WSA interpolator has a second digital gain for its mix input,
"WSA_RXn_MIX Digital Volume", which also resets to 0 dB, so a stream
routed through the mix input bypasses the -3 dB limit of the main gain.
Limit it to the same value.

